      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tiradii Boqorradii Laga Adkaaday",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba kuwanu waa boqorradii dalka, oo ay reer binu Israa'iil laayeen oo ay dalkoodii ka qaateen meel Webi Urdun ka shishaysa oo qorrax ka soo baxa ka xigta, markii laga bilaabo dooxadii Arnoon iyo tan iyo Buur Xermoon, iyo inta banka Caraabaah xagga bari ka xigta oo dhan: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo waxay ahaayeen boqorkii reer Amor oo ahaa Siixon, oo degganaa Xeshboon, oo xukumi jiray Carooceer oo ku tiil dooxadii Arnoon darafteeda, iyo magaaladii ku tiil dooxadii dhexdeeda, iyo Gilecaad badhkeed, iyo tan iyo Webi Yabboq, kaasoo ku yiil soohdintii reer Cammoon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo bankii Caraabaah iyo tan iyo baddii Kinnered, iyo xagga bari, iyo tan iyo baddii Caraabaah, taas oo ah Badda Cusbada leh, oo bari, ee ku taal jidkii Beytyeshimood, ee xagga koonfureed, ee ka hoosaysay dhaadhacyadii Fisgaah: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo xuduudkii Coog oo ahaa boqorkii Baashaan, oo ka hadhay reer Rafaa ee Cashtarod agteeda joogay, Edrecii agteedana joogay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaasu wuxuu xukumi jiray Buur Xermoon, iyo Salkaah, iyo Baashaan oo dhan, iyo tan iyo soohdinta reer Geshuur iyo kan reer Macakaad iyo Gilecaad badhkeed, iyo xuduudka Siixon oo boqor u ahaa Xeshboon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Addoonkii Rabbiga oo Muuse ahaa iyo reer binu Israa'iil baa laayay iyagii, oo addoonkii Rabbiga oo Muuse ahaa ayaa reer Ruubeen iyo reer Gaad, iyo reer Manaseh badhkood hanti ahaan u siiyey.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
